<title>USA: Houston Exploration has East Cameron blowout.</title>
<headline>Houston Exploration has East Cameron blowout.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Houston Exploration Co said Monday well #C1 at East Cameron Blocks 82/83 encountered uncontrolled gas flow during completion operations this weekend.</p>
<p>All personnel were safely evacuated from the rig, and there was no fire and no pollution. All appropriate authorities have been notified. Well control experts are currently on the scene and operations are underway to regain control of the gas flow, the company said.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
